13	// generations kept live. Appending a layer past the window rebuilds the chain
14	// around its newest members (Checkpoint rebases against the unchanged WAL);
15	// compaction retires every layer outside the window with the old WAL and
16	// re-anchors the surviving layers against the replacement log, after which
